 "input": "Apache release, the way our PMC does it. release manager creates the release candidate from the release branch, signs the source tarball with their GPG key (key has to be in the project KEYS file). artifacts uploaded to dist/dev staging area. RM sends the [VOTE] email to dev@ list, vote stays open at least 72 hours. needs 3 binding +1 from PMC members and more +1 than -1. voters check signatures, checksums, licence headers (RAT tool) and that it builds. if it passes, RM sends [RESULT] email, moves artifacts to dist/release, then announces on announce@ after mirrors sync. failed vote = fix and new RC.",
